26?\u1864?\u1836?\u1857?\u1816?\u1855?\u1826? \u1824?\u1849?\u1815? \u1792?\lang1048\f3\line\f0\fs24 28 u\u275?\'b7eryim I\u234?\'bau\u333?a q\u257?l\u234?\'b7H\'e2 c\u275?d m\u275?l\u234?\u402? \u7685?\'ee\'b7H\u275?ic\'e2l\u257?e u\u234?\'b7em\u275?r \line U\'ee\'b7Ly\'b7I i\u257?dayin e\u275?n\'e2\u7789?u\u333?n u\'ee\'b7m\u275?n e\u275?im\u234?c\u257?e E\u234?n\u257?e i\u257?dayin e\u275?n\'e2\u7789?u\u333?n u\'ee\'b7m\u275?n \u7789?\'e2vu\u333?t n\u275?f\'e2\'ba\'b7I l\u257?e e\u234?tyit e\u234?l\u257?e \'ba\u275?ryir Hu\u333? m\u275?n \u7693?\'ee\'b7\'ba\u275?\u7693?r\u275?n\'b7I Hu\u333? \u7693?\u275?\'b7en\'e2\u7789?u\u333?n l\u257?e i\u257?dayin e\u275?n\'e2\u7789?u\u333?n l\u234?\'b7H\'e2 .\line\'aai ridicat Ie\'baua voce-I c\'e2nd \'eenv\'e3\'fe\'e3tor \'een Templu \'bai spune:\~  \line\endash\'aai Mie-Mi cunoscu\'fei voi \'bai din de-unde Mie cunoscu\'fei voi \'bai din dorin\'fe\'e3 sufletu-Mi ne venit ci veridic El din de trimisu-Mi El de vou\'e3 ne cunocu\'fei voi Celui..\line\line\lang1114\f1\fs27\u1808?\u1848?\u1826?\u1845?\u1808? \u1813?\u1857?\u1849?\u1821?\u1826? \u1821?\u1845?\u1813?\u1858?\u1842?\u1829? \u1808?\u1864?\u1826?\u1845?\u1808? \u1824?\u1849?\u1815? \u1813?\u1857?\u1825?\u1848?\u1826? \u1824?\u1816?\u1845?\u1836?\u1858?\u1849?\u1815? \u1808?\u1848?\u1826?\u1845?\u1808? \u1816?\u1815?\u1816?\u1855? \u1835?\u1842?\u1813?\u1857?\u1834?\u1842?\u1826?\u1821? \u1792?\lang1048\f3\line\f0\fs24 29 E\u234?n\u257?e \u7693?\u234?in i\u257?d\u275?a E\u234?n\u257?e l\u234?\'b7H\'ee \u7693?\'ee\'b7m\u275?n lu\u257?t\u234?\'b7H\'e2 E\u234?n\u257?e u\'ee\'b7Hu\u333? \'ba\u275?\u7693?r\u275?n\'b7I .\line Eu, dar, \'batiu Eu Lui dintre spre El Eu \'bai El trimisu-I.\line\line\lang1114\f1\fs27\u1816?\u1842?\u1810?\u1858?\u1829?\u1842?\u1816? \u1824?\u1825?\u1848?\u1808?\u1818?\u1813?\u1857?\u1849?\u1815? \u1816?\u1824?\u1845?\u1808? \u1808?\u1864?\u1826?\u1845?\u1835? \u1808?\u1842?\u1834?\u1825?\u1821?\u1852? \u1829?\u1824?\u1842?\u1816?\u1815?\u1864?\u